    dct:title "Health-RI Semantic Interoperability Initiative's Person Birth";
    dct:issued "2026"^^xsd:gYear;
    dcat:theme lcc:R;
    skos:editorialNote "This Catalog entry contains the Person Birth extract from the larger Health-RI Ontology, together with supporting classes retained for structural coherence. Its scope covers person birth events and multiplicity; birth places and derived temporal attributes; and genetic and gestational provenance. Other Health-RI Ontology subject areas are outside this entry.";
